{"id":"n32183-1-12","stage":5,"title":"극도 · 极度","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32183-1-12-1","ko":"오빠는 오늘 왜 저렇게 예민해?","zh":"哥哥今天怎么那么敏感？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오빠는","meaning":"哥哥，大哥","explanation":"오빠：哥哥，大哥；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오빠","audio":"/audio/14e10e3b73bff8540288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68006","senseId":"2","lemma":"오빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"저렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"저렇다","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71226","senseId":"1","lemma":"저렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예민해?","meaning":"敏感","explanation":"예민하다：敏感；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"예민하다","audio":"/audio/07e96f3c93ffb0ed67f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68449","senseId":"3","lemma":"예민하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"14e10e3b73bff854","term":"오빠","zh":"哥哥，大哥","audio":"/audio/14e10e3b73bff8540288.mp3","entryId":"68006","definition":"女子用于亲切地指称或称呼比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["오빠"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"07e99c1628a5077b","term":"저렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3","entryId":"71226","definition":"性质、模样、状态等与那个一样。","pronunciation":["저러타"]},{"id":"07e96f3c93ffb0ed","term":"예민하다","zh":"敏感","audio":"/audio/07e96f3c93ffb0ed67f6.mp3","entryId":"68449","definition":"对刺激所做出的反应或感觉过于敏锐。","pronunciation":["예ː민하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c91d6e233fc485d88306.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n32183-1-12-2","ko":"내일이 시험이잖니. 신경이 극도로 예민하니까 조용히 하렴.","zh":"他明天要考试，神经正绷得很紧，安静一点吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일이","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시험이잖니.","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；잖니：提醒听者双方已知的事实，带反问或确认语气：“不是……吗”。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신경이","meaning":"神经","explanation":"신경：神经；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"신경","audio":"/audio/601d03a22ce3fa90ef0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13994","senseId":"2","lemma":"신경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"극도로","meaning":"极度，极点","explanation":"극도：极度，极点；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"극도","audio":"/audio/25f7e0a6cefd9cf8c466.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32183","senseId":"1","lemma":"극도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예민하니까","meaning":"敏感","explanation":"예민하다：敏感；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"예민하다","audio":"/audio/07e96f3c93ffb0ed67f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68449","senseId":"3","lemma":"예민하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조용히","meaning":"安静地","explanation":"조용히：安静地","readings":[{"term":"조용히","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75797","senseId":"1","lemma":"조용히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하렴.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；렴：向亲近的人